  NPCName: Guide Lady
  NPCImage: {fileID: 529665991, guid: 9b185a2a999ca9540aa051c927ab3d3d, type: 3}
  endGameNPC: 0
  dialogueLines:
  - Hi, Kid! I'm The Guide.
  - You want to ask something?
  - Ok, go ahead
  - Uh... Have a good day!
  - You are in the Islet World.
  - Besides this village, there are 6 island with different biomes.
  - Each island has dangerous monsters and a boss.
  - Be careful when you explore other islands.
  - You will receive 1 artifact when you defeat the boss.
  - When you collect all 6 artifacts, look for the man in purple.
  - He will take you home.
  - Goodluck on this adventure!
  autoProgessLines: 000000000000000000000000
